[l_braz_por.landmark_berlin_volkshalle]
Volkshalle

[l_braz_por.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_desc]
O Volkshalle representa o espírito inabalável de nosso povo e sua determinação em dominar o mundo. Ele mostrará a todos que, com a força da conquista, tudo é possível, e a pátria é capaz de realizar até as tarefas mais improváveis.

[l_braz_por.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_plural]
$landmark_berlin_volkshalle$

[l_english.landmark_berlin_volkshalle]
Volkshalle

[l_english.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_desc]
The Volkshalle stands as a testament to our people's indomitable spirit, and their prideful will to dominate the globe. It will show the world that, through the might of conquest, anything is possible, and the fatherland can make even the most impossible task possible.

[l_english.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_plural]
$landmark_berlin_volkshalle$

[l_french.landmark_berlin_volkshalle]
Volkshalle

[l_french.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_desc]
Le Volkshalle est un monument à la gloire de la volonté de fer de notre peuple et leur soif de domination mondiale. Il prouvera au monde entier que la conquête concrétise tous les rêves, et que rien n'est impossible pour la patrie.

[l_french.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_plural]
$landmark_berlin_volkshalle$

[l_german.landmark_berlin_volkshalle]
Volkshalle

[l_german.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_desc]
Die Volkshalle zeugt von dem unbeugsamen Geist unseres Volkes und seinem stolzen Willen, die Welt zu beherrschen. Sie ist ein Symbol, das der Welt vor Augen führt, dass durch eine Eroberung alles möglich ist und unser Vaterland selbst jenes erreichen kann, was unmöglich schien.

[l_german.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_plural]
$landmark_berlin_volkshalle$

[l_japanese.landmark_berlin_volkshalle]
人民の広間

[l_japanese.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_desc]
人民の広間は、我々ドイツ国民の不屈の精神と世界を支配するという誇り高い意志の証だ。征服の力によって、何事も可能であることを世界に示すだろう。祖国は、どんなに不可能なことでも可能にすることができるのだ。

[l_japanese.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_plural]
$landmark_berlin_volkshalle$

[l_korean.landmark_berlin_volkshalle]
국민대회당

[l_korean.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_desc]
국민대회당은 우리 민족의 불굴의 정신과 세계를 지배하려는 자랑스러운 의지를 증명하는 상징입니다. 이 건축물은 정복의 힘을 통해 무엇이든 가능하며, 조국이 가장 불가능한 일조차 실현할 수 있음을 전 세계에 보여줍니다.

[l_korean.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_plural]
$landmark_berlin_volkshalle$

[l_polish.landmark_berlin_volkshalle]
Volkshalle

[l_polish.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_desc]
Volkshalle to świadectwo hartu ducha naszych obywateli i ich dumnego dążenia do opanowania świata. Ta budowla pokaże światu, że dzięki potędze podboju wszystko jest możliwe, a ojczyzna potrafi zrealizować nawet najbardziej ambitne plany.

[l_polish.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_plural]
$landmark_berlin_volkshalle$

[l_russian.landmark_berlin_volkshalle]
Зал Народа

[l_russian.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_desc]
Зал Народа символизирует неукротимую волю наших людей и их достойное желание доминировать в мире. Он покажет всем, что мощью завоеваний можно добиться чего угодно и что наша отчизна способна воплотить в жизнь даже самые, казалось бы, невыполнимые мечты.

[l_russian.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_plural]
$landmark_berlin_volkshalle$

[l_simp_chinese.landmark_berlin_volkshalle]
人民大厅

[l_simp_chinese.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_desc]
人民大厅象征着我们民族不可战胜的精神，以及他们征服世界的自豪意志。它将向全世界展示，通过征服的力量，一切皆有可能，祖国甚至可以使最不可能的任务成为可能。

[l_simp_chinese.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_plural]
$landmark_berlin_volkshalle$

[l_spanish.landmark_berlin_volkshalle]
Volkshalle

[l_spanish.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_desc]
El Volkshalle es la prueba del espíritu indomable de nuestro pueblo y de su orgullosa voluntad de dominar el mundo. Demostrará al mundo que, por medio del poder de la conquista, cualquier cosa es posible, y que la patria puede hacer realidad incluso la tarea más impensable.

[l_spanish.landmark_berlin_volkshalle_plural]
$landmark_berlin_volkshalle$

